link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:30bd1200-6627-44d6-b1d6-30f4aa02267b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:30bd1200-6627-44d6-b1d6-30f4aa02267b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a pouch behind the bar at <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-76&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;145</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>We need to meet. The map is ready. Go to my place; head into the basement.\n</p><p><br>\nLook for the tower - you should have the key.\n</p><p><br>\nIGNORE THE CHEST - I mean it. Go straight on through and you'll find it.\n</p><p><br>\nSigned,\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Mason\" title=\"Infernal Mason\">Morfred</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203143\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1609/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29241/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6878/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936347/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.531      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.531      1 -t